        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-745, Gibraltar Knob Collection</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Gibraltar Cabinet Knob is available in two sizes. The Large Gibraltar knob has a 1-1/2 inch diameter while the RK International Small Gibraltar knob has a 1-1/4 inch diameter. Both of these kitchen cabinet drawer knobs were designed to match well with the <a href=\"/products/gibraltar-cabinet-pull-series-rk-international-cp-825\"><b>Gibraltar Cabinet Pull</b></a>; but they could easily be matched with any modern or transitional cabinet hardware. The Gibraltar Knob is available as a satin brass knobs, black kitchen hardware, and in an even satin nickel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/gibraltar-cabinet-pull-series-rk-international-cp-825\"><b>Matching Gibraltar Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/site/product.cfm?id=\"><b>Gibraltar Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International Gibraltar Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>Small Gibraltar Knob CK-727:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Large Gibraltar Knob CK-726:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
